{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>據《彭博》的 Mark Gurman 表示，Apple 計劃為旗下 HomeView 智能家居中樞推出規格更高的版本，該裝置配備更大的螢幕，並可作全方位旋轉。</p>\n<h2>9 吋螢幕可 360 度旋轉</h2>\n<p>這款高階版本的螢幕尺寸為 9 吋，可安裝在機械臂上作 360 度全方位旋轉。Gurman 預期裝置會在 2027 或 2028 年推出。相比之下，現時的桌上型 HomeView 配備固定的 7 吋螢幕。</p>\n<h2>高階版本名稱仍屬推測</h2>\n<p>Gurman 提出 HomeView Max、HomeView Ultra 及 HomeView 360 等名稱，不過這些名稱目前僅屬推測。</p>\n<img alt=\"與 HomeView 相關的圖片\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/homeview-2.webp\">\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-18T22:18:46.520065+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":278,"images":1,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-18T22:12:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-19T07:38:04.840867+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-18T22:17:35.424061+00:00","content_hash":"f9791bc0fd7d3cae926901e11b7698e5b6557723e32a6625656ea24bb242fa7c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}